## Customer Slack channel naming

Productboard-wide convention — same for all AISEs, never user-specific:

- **External shared channel with customer (client-facing):** `#ext-{customer}`
- **Internal channel about the customer:** `#accounts-{customer}`
- **Coverage:** Not every customer has dedicated Slack channels. When channels are absent, default to follow-up emails.

